  _signatureText: She leaves the road to hunt your cold towers across the map and smashes each into a wreck you can rebuild. Without cold towers she walks the road. Her trail of lava burns towers it touches; below half her health she lays eggs in the lava.
  _telegraphText: A thin line of heat runs from her to her first target, and that tower starts to glow warm.
  _counterText: Use a cheap cold tower far from the road as bait so she walks past your firepower, or build no cold at all and let her take the long road. Shoot her eggs before they hatch.
